de levens van Ugwu, Olanna en Richard met elkaar verbonden. Ugwu vindt werk in het huis van een professor, waar Olanna komt wonen nadat ze haar welvarende omgeving in Lagos heeft verlaten. De Engelsman Richard voelt zich aangetrokken tot haar tweelingzus. Tegen deze achtergrond breekt de oorlog om Biafra uit. De veranderende omstandigheden maken hun verschillen scherper en stellen hun onderlinge verbondenheid en overtuigingen op de proef.","work_id":987103002,"evidence":[{"note":"Half of a Yellow Sun is not Americanah, Purple Hibiscus, essay collections or Dream Count in the complete captured author corpus. Exact Dutch ISBN and KB original Knopf2006 match the visually reviewed front.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p407902341"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-004.json#15","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:16:06.000Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-001.json","sources":["https://www.debezigebij.nl/boek/een-halve-gele-zon/","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL5731542W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p407902341"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"d0241560daa2b2045665647ada3ddd0b593c712445c360cfcf4fdc15a7a6fc47","cover_id":8081802,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-002.json","limitation":"Front title/author and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact printing-year claim."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://www.debezigebij.nl/boek/een-halve-gele-zon/","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T17:16:06+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-004","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":987303002},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":987203002},"seq":22,"relation":