 Pitt schiet te hulp en redt onder anderen Kelly Egan, wier vader aan de bijzondere motortechniek werkte. De uitvinder overleeft de ramp niet, maar zijn aantekeningen blijven bewaard. Wanneer Pitt de oorzaak van het zinken onderzoekt, ontstaan vragen over de waarde van die uitvindingen en de belangen die ermee gemoeid zijn. De speurtocht brengt maritieme techniek samen met een machtige tegenstander.","work_id":987103004,"evidence":[{"note":"Original publisher credits Clive Cussler. Inferno op zee/Valhalla Rising and its maritime-engineering premise differ from all nine captured Cussler Works; KB original Putnam2001 and exact Dutch ISBN agree.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p237907356"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-004.json#51","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:16:06.000Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-005.json","sources":["https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/351848/valhalla-rising-by-clive-cussler/","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL84889W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p237907356"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[{"name":"Scott Brick","role":"audio narrator; not a print coauthor"}],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"2ab3370745135a8f2666b1c2fc7ecb5c25cdcaa7d51a71d44e2066d1c4fd58ac","cover_id":8765780,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-002.json","limitation":"Front title/author and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact printing-year claim."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/351848/valhalla-rising-by-clive-cussler/","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T17:16:06+00:00","source_name":"Gecontroleerde boek- en catalogusbronnen","source_type":"official_catalog","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-004","review_status":"approved","bound_author_id":987303003},"before_row":null},{"key":{"edition_id":987203004},"seq":30,"relation":"catalog_edition_metadata","after_row":{"format":"hardcover","work_id":987103004,"evidence":[{"note":"Original publisher credits Clive Cussler. Inferno op zee/Valhalla Rising and its maritime-engineering premise differ from all nine captured Cussler Works; KB original Putnam2001 and exact Dutch ISBN agree.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p237907356"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-004.json#51","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:16:06.000Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-005.json","sources":["https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/351848/valhalla-rising-by-clive-cussler/","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL84889W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p237907356"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[{"name":"Scott Brick","role":"audio narrator; not a print coauthor"}],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"2ab3370745135a8f2666b1c2fc7ecb5c25cdcaa7d51a71d44e2066d1c4fd58ac","cover_id":8765780,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-002.json","limitation":"Front title/author and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact printing-year claim."}],"cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/8765780-L.jpg?default=false","edition_id":987203004,"bound_title":"Inferno op zee","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T17:16:06+00:00","bound_isbn13":"9789051085853","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p237907356","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-004","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/8765780-M.jpg?default=false","bound_author_id":987303003},"before_row":null},{"key":{"native_identity_key":"nlscale:20261102:ol:OL3899224W"},"seq":31,"relation":"works","after_row":{"id":987103005,"title":"Roseanna","cover_id":14103315,"author_id":987303004,"work_type":"novel","source_type":"open_library","open_library_id":"OL3899224W","first_publish_year":1965,"native_identity_key":"nlscale:20261102:ol:OL3899224W"},"before_row":null},{"key":{"open_library_edition_id":"OL47493098M"},"seq":32,"relation":"editions","after_row":{"id":987203005,"title":"De vrouw in het Götakanaal","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789044912890","work_id":987103005,"cover_id":14103315,"language":"dut","publisher":"A W Bruna & Zoon","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":"OL47493098M"},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987103005,"language":"nl"},"seq":33,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"De vondst van het lichaam van een jonge vrouw stelt rechercheur Martin Beck voor een onderzoek met nauwelijks aanknopingspunten. Eerst moet duidelijk worden wie zij was en hoe haar reis is verlopen. De naam Roseanna brengt het team dichter bij een groep mogelijke getuigen en verdachten, maar geeft nog geen antwoord op de vraag wie haar heeft gedood. Het verhaal volgt een langzaam onderzoek waarin kleine gegevens stap voor stap betekenis krijgen.","work_id":987103005,"evidence":[{"note":"Roseanna is Martin Beck volume1, not Per Wahlöö''s current Stålsprånget/Springveer. KB exact Dutch ISBN and original Roseanna1965 bind the novel. Keep one existing-model primary author Maj Sjöwall; preserve joint-credit evidence, never fabricate a combined-author identity.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p045950350","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p410551201","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p83335034X"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-004.json#62","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:16:06.000Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-006.json","sources":["https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/184715/roseanna-by-maj-sjowall-and-per-wahloo/","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL3899224W","https://data.bibliotheken.n