655M"},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987103006,"language":"nl"},"seq":37,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Een opschepperige belofte van het dorpshoofd brengt Asterix en Obelix in moeilijkheden. Tegenover zijn zwager heeft hij aangekondigd een stoofpot te serveren die met Caesars lauwerkrans op smaak is gebracht. Zijn twee dorpsgenoten krijgen de opdracht die ongewone toevoeging in Rome te bemachtigen. Om dicht bij Caesar te komen zoeken zij een ingang in de wereld van slaven en hun eigenaars. De Galliërs moeten hun plan uitvoeren tussen Romeinen die vooral hun eigen voordeel zoeken.","work_id":987103006,"evidence":[{"note":"Exact Dutch album ISBN9789032004736, French original and reviewed front identify Caesar''s laurel-wreath album. Goscinny script/Uderzo art are distinct roles. Comic remains outside automatic novel/taste eligibility.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p841972567"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-004.json#67","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:16:06.000Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-amendment-001.json","sources":["https://www.hachette.co.uk/titles/ren%C3%A9-goscinny-2/asterix-asterix-and-the-laurel-wreath/9780752866376/","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p841972567"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[{"name":"Albert Uderzo","role":"original artist"}],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"162b82af22b26caa7c71975db32e49f66aedc6ebd7986457f9f36f731a5137df","cover_id":13137506,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-003.json","limitation":"Front title/author and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact printing-year claim."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://www.hachette.co.uk/titles/ren%C3%A9-goscinny-2/asterix-asterix-and-the-laurel-wreath/978