"9789024561988","evidence_url":"https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p355270374","review_batch":"nl-scale-20261102-004","review_status":"approved","bound_language":"dut","card_cover_url":"https://covers.openlibrary.org/b/id/10140811-M.jpg?default=false","bound_author_id":987303007},"before_row":null},{"key":{"native_identity_key":"nlscale:20261102:ol:OL3899215W"},"seq":55,"relation":"works","after_row":{"id":987103011,"title":"Brandbilen som försvann","cover_id":13521524,"author_id":987303004,"work_type":"novel","source_type":"open_library","open_library_id":"OL3899215W","first_publish_year":1969,"native_identity_key":"nlscale:20261102:ol:OL3899215W"},"before_row":null},{"key":{"open_library_edition_id":"OL47129777M"},"seq":56,"relation":"editions","after_row":{"id":987203011,"title":"De brandweerauto die verdween","isbn_10":null,"isbn_13":"9789044915129","work_id":987103011,"cover_id":13521524,"language":"dut","publisher":"Bruna Uitgevers, A.W.","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":"OL47129777M"},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987103011,"language":"nl"},"seq":57,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Een observatie in Stockholm verandert in een ramp wanneer een woonhuis ontploft. Rechercheur Gunvald Larsson is vlakbij, maar kan niet voorkomen dat er slachtoffers vallen. Martin Beck en zijn collega''s onderzoeken wat aanvankelijk een brand lijkt. Een zelfmoord op dezelfde dag levert een vreemd aanknopingspunt op: de overledene heeft Becks naam achtergelaten. Het onderzoek moet uitwijzen of de gebeurtenissen samenhangen en wat er aan de explosie voorafging.","work_id":987103011,"evidence":[{"note":"Brandbilen som försvann1969 is Martin Beck volume5. Two source edition IDs share exact ISBN9789044915129: propose only the bound visually reviewed edition, never both. Different historical Dutch reprint dates are not new Works.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p049243071","https: