987103016,"cover_id":12667373,"language":"dut","publisher":"Boekerij","publish_date":null,"open_library_edition_id":"OL37752831M"},"before_row":null},{"key":{"work_id":987103016,"language":"nl"},"seq":77,"relation":"catalog_work_descriptions","after_row":{"text":"Een dodelijk auto-ongeluk heeft Promise Falls verdeeld. De jonge bestuurder beweert zich niets te herinneren en krijgt volgens veel inwoners een te lichte straf. Privédetective Cal Weaver wordt gevraagd de bedreigingen tegen diens familie te onderzoeken. Hij neemt de opdracht aan, hoewel ook voor hem niet alles duidelijk is. Al snel blijken woede en vergelding zich tot meer dan dreigende woorden te ontwikkelen. Cal moet uitzoeken wie daadwerkelijk van plan is de straf zelf uit te voeren.","work_id":987103016,"evidence":[{"note":"Parting Shot/Onhoudbaar differs from A Tap on the Window, Too Close to Home, No Safe House and Fear the Worst in the full captured Barclay corpus. KB exact NLISBN and LondonOrion2017 original agree.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p413355497"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-004.json#139","checked_at":"2026-11-02T17:16:06.000Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-010.json","sources":["https://openlibrary.org/works/OL19718480W","https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p413355497"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"type":"cover_front_review","sha256":"1329ace3849f961a684bab87a17835128815304865173c9c249b7b8f33af7284","cover_id":12667373,"reference":"cover-semantic-review-002.json","limitation":"Front title/author and source-edition binding; no barcode or exact printing-year claim."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"https://openlibrary.org/works/OL19718480W","reviewed_at":"2026-11-02T17:16:06+00:00","source_name